# Every version the benchmark VM pins, in one file.
#
# Sourced by the scripts in this directory. A toolchain that floats changes the
# SDK pass between two rounds without anybody deciding it; a pin makes the
# change a diff.
#
# Each pinned value below was confirmed to exist on 2026-11-08 (the source is
# named on its line). Bumping one is a deliberate act: change it here, re-run
# the script that consumes it, and say so in the run notes.
#
# What is NOT pinned, and why: packages from Ubuntu 24.04's own archive (JDK 21,
# Maven, PHP 8.3, Composer, CMake, the C/C++ toolchain) follow the distribution's
# security updates, and Docker Engine follows Docker's stable channel. 04-verify.sh
# enforces the minimum each of them must meet and records the exact versions in
# ~/bench/logs/toolchains.txt, which goes in the run notes.

# The AXIAM release the round measures (claude_dev/bench-vm-runbook.md §6.1). The
# image ghcr.io/ilpanich/axiam/server:${AXIAM_TAG#v} must be published.
AXIAM_TAG="${AXIAM_TAG:-v1.3.0}"

# k6, the load generator. The newest release on GitHub on 2026-11-08; run 5 used
# 2.1.0. Changing it moves numbers slightly: record it.
K6_VERSION="2.3.0"

# Rust, for the Rust SDK bench (the SDK's rust-version is 1.89). Current stable
# per static.rust-lang.org/dist/channel-rust-stable.toml.
RUST_VERSION="1.99.1"

# Node.js major line (the TypeScript SDK's engines field says >= 22), from
# NodeSource's repository; the patch follows that line.
NODE_MAJOR="22"

# Go, for the Go SDK bench (go.mod says go 1.26.0). Listed by
# proxy.golang.org/golang.org/toolchain/@v/list.
GO_VERSION="1.27.3"

# .NET SDK channel (the C# SDK targets net10.0). dotnet-install.sh installs the
# newest patch of the channel; 04-verify.sh records which.
DOTNET_CHANNEL="10.0"

# Swift (the Swift SDK's swift-tools-version is 6.2). Listed with an Ubuntu 24.04
# build by swift.org/api/v1/install/releases.json.
SWIFT_VERSION="6.4.2"

# Where the checkouts and logs live on the VM.
BENCH_DIR="${BENCH_DIR:-$HOME/bench}"

# The eleven SDK repositories, as ilpanich/axiam-<name>-sdk.
SDK_REPOS="${SDK_REPOS:-rust typescript python java kotlin csharp php go swift c cplusplus}"
